{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 52,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER052.YBC",
      "sha256": "2112110f4473bdf47f966ac9c82922654cc6840f2a553dcdb5e0fdafa1379a15",
      "text_count": 29,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "你們現在的心情如何啊，純潔之盾呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 256,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司‧謬斯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 290,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "差不多也該好好確認一下了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 312,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾究竟是否有位列四大學級的實力呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 346,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 372,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 440,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "唉呀唉呀，你們兩位都需要冷靜一下唷。\n可以嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 486,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "不要多管閒事啦，\n像修貝流士這樣的小國，\n沒有資格做這種事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 520,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "唉唷～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 542,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "你不要老是注意那些無聊的事情嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 570,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "倒是呢，你們只不過來了五個人，\n這樣就想打贏我們？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 596,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 628,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "無論如何，\n這都是很輕率的舉動呀，不是嗎～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 668,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "如果我們全部都一起來，\n就沒辦法感受你們那微小的實力了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 702,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "……很好～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 756,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 790,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "那麼，艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 818,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "如果妳不想跟他們作戰的話，\n是不是現在退下會比較好？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 852,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "不。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 874,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "我是為了戰鬥才加入這裡的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 896,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "怎麼可能會有退縮的理由呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 52,
          "source_offset": 958,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "那麼，就為我們期待已久的宴會揭開序幕吧。"
        }
      ],
